{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "19c5a727-abd6-8eed-8386-8d20646a9d6a",
  "created_at": "2025-12-11T14:22:44-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Patrick Donovan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:20:12-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:20:17-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Streetlight's out. Crosswalk near me is dark."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:20:21-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a streetlight out at a crosswalk. Can you tell me where that is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:20:27-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "382 Farewell Street. North End. The crosswalk is right out front, a little toward the school."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:20:34-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three eighty-two Farewell Street. Got it. And is it the one light that's out, or the whole block?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:20:42-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just the one over the crosswalk. Pole's right at the corner of it. Whole crossing is black at night now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:20:51-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So the light on the pole at the crosswalk, in front of 382. How long has it been out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:21:00-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Week. Maybe eight days. It's dark by four-thirty now. I don't feel safe crossing there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:21:07-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I understand that. Especially with the school so close, there's foot traffic there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:21:13-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. I can hear the school bell from my yard. Faint, but I hear it. Kids cross there in the morning, it's still dim then too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:21:24-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's a good point, I'll note that it's near the school. Is there a number on the pole, like a little tag or sticker?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:21:34-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hold on. [pause] Can't see one from here. It's dark out there, I'd have to walk out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:21:41-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's all right, the address and the crosswalk will do. Is it completely dark, or does it flicker on and off?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:21:50-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Completely dark. Doesn't flicker. Just off."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:21:53-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'm putting in a request for a crew to come check the pole. Let me read it back. Streetlight out over the crosswalk at 382 Farewell Street, North End, near the school, dark about a week, no flickering. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:22:10-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Can you send somebody to look at the pole?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:22:15-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's what the request is for. Someone will go out and look at it. Do you want a call when it's done? I have a number here, is it four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-nine-nine?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:22:28-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. Yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:22:30-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Anything else I can help with today, Mr. Donovan?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:22:35-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. That's all. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:22:38-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care, and watch yourself out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:22:42-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Bye."
    }
  ],
